<title>USA: El Dorado, Kan., won by Country Club Bank.</title>
<headline>El Dorado, Kan., won by Country Club Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Country Club Bank said it won $2.887 million of El Dorado, Kan., general obligation bonds, Series B 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.711 percent.</p>
</text>
